      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A friend of mine encountered this but or a similar one to it yesterday. Their physbones stopped working locally for that specific avatar and would only work when a specific gesture was made. All physbones seem to work correctly on remote. Best guess as to the cause might've had something to do with a tongue physbone or something. \n\nResetting the avatar seems to have fixed the issue for that avatar and we have not been able to get the bug to happen again though.",
